        "cooked": "<p>Don't know if anyone else has been reading this from here, but Luther (one of Tactic's designers) has been posting some cool stuff about the history of the development of the game <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1282920/secret-history-sentinel-tactics-characters\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Right over here&nbsp;on BGG</a>.</p><p>Some really great stuff, and some info on the early versions of Both AZ and Blade have been posted. &nbsp;Cool reading.</p>",
