        "created_at": "2014-12-17T02:43:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was a really awesome read, Luther--it's neat to see what goes into designers' revision and development process. &nbsp;I've seen what it looks like on the rpg end and, while I've prototyped a few board games, I haven't been able to see it from the board game end. &nbsp;Thanks for sharing and I hope to see more!</p>",
